## Parameters

<ParamField header="Idempotency-Key" type={"string"} required>
Identifies one logical mutation across retries.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="organizationId" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

<ParamField path="projectId" type={"string"} required>
The project being billed.
</ParamField>


## Body

<ParamField body="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ParamField>

<ParamField body="planCode" type={"string"} required>
Plan to subscribe to, e.g. analytics_pro.
</ParamField>


## Returns

**`200`** The idempotency key resolved to an operation that is already terminal. TerminalBillingOperation

